                <head>Text of the Copyright Convention.</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Tokio November 10, 1905.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ratification advised by the Senate February 28,
                        1906.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ratified by the President March 7, 1906.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ratified by Japan April 28, 1906.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ratifications exchanged at Tokio May 10, 1906.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Proclaimed May 17, 1906.</hi></p>



